# Local-only fast feedback: format and autofix just the staged TypeScript, nothing more.
# CI stays the source of truth (it runs typecheck, lint, format:check, build, tests,
# publint and a packed-tarball smoke test), so this hook is deliberately cheap enough
# that nobody reaches for --no-verify. It never runs in CI: every workflow sets HUSKY=0,
# which makes the `prepare` script a no-op there.
npx lint-staged
